sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Owner
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant A as Architect (most capable model)
    participant E as Engineer (cheaper model)
    participant G as Git host

    W->>O: request
    O->>W: blocking questions (if any)
    O->>A: spec file
    A-->>O: plan file
    opt big or risky
        O->>W: plan summary
        W-->>O: approve
    end
    O->>E: brief file (plan path, constraints)
    E->>G: commits, PR
    E-->>O: report file (changes, test counts)
    O->>A: review package (diff as a file)
    A-->>O: verdict + findings
    O->>G: review comment
    loop until approved, max 3 rounds
        O->>E: open findings
        E->>G: fix commits
        O->>A: fix diff + findings
        A-->>O: ADDRESSED / NOT ADDRESSED
    end
    O->>W: PR, evidence, rulings, next decision
